 libreoffice-impress,
 libreoffice-gnome,
 libreoffice-help-en-us,
 hunspell-en-us,
 hyphen-en-us,
 mythes-en-us
Description: @DISTRIBUTION@ office productivity suite
 Adds the LibreOffice office suite (Writer / Calc / Impress) plus
 GNOME integration shim and en-US dictionaries (Hunspell spell
 check, Hyphen hyphenation, MyThes thesaurus) to the @DISTRIBUTION@
 desktop set.
 .
 Selecting this metapackage automatically pulls asgard-gnome-desktop
 so a single `apt install asgard-office` brings up a complete
 office-ready desktop without separate steps.
 .
 Pattern B per docs/branding-methodology.md — operator-facing
 convenience that coexists with the pkg.list groups and tasksel.
